<title>JAPAN: MOODY'S CUTS RATING OUTLOOK OF FOUR JAPANESE BANKS.</title>
<headline>MOODY'S CUTS RATING OUTLOOK OF FOUR JAPANESE BANKS.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Monday that it had lowered its ratings outlook for Nippon Credit Bank Ltd , Hokkaido Takushoku Bank Ltd , Yasuda Trust &amp; Banking Co Ltd and Chuo Trust &amp; Banking Co Ltd to negative from stable.</p>
</text>
